§ `Capacity`
    GIVEN `has capacity` IS A BOOLEAN TYPICALLY TRUE

@export Can contract
GIVEN `is adult` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`can contract` MEANS `is adult` AND `has capacity`

#EVAL `can contract` TRUE
